      <h2 id="cpmso-yaml-failure-domain-vsphere_cpmso-config-options-vsphere" class="group scroll-mt-20">Sample VMware vSphere failure domain configuration<a href="#cpmso-yaml-failure-domain-vsphere_cpmso-config-options-vsphere" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
